================ LETHAL DUAL ENGINE  n=4 m=12  DIM=161051  partitions=15 ================
Author: Rafael Amichis Luengo (Madrid). Method: Degtyarev-Shimada (arXiv:1405.4683 S5).
char-p: CRT block split of F_p[t]/phi = A x B (phi = (t-1)^a * g^b). Blocks reduced one at a
        time and released; RAM peak = largest single block. No extension-field arithmetic.
GATE every run: sum of per-block ranks must equal the monolithic rank, else VOID.

